<title>USA: Bonal International expanding facilities.</title>
<headline>Bonal International expanding facilities.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bonal International Inc said Tuesday it will expand its facilities by 50 percent through the lease of additional office space, effective April 1.</p>
<p>The move will increase its facilities by 3,900 square feet to 11,600 square feet and will accommodate 28 people of whom 15 will be new employees added over the next year.</p>
<p>Bonal develops sub-harmonic vibrational stress relief technology and manufacutres META-LAX Stress Relieving equipment.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
